      "subject": "נפשו בכפו",
      "rationale": "'em i putim laip bilong en long palma bilong en' — tok Hibru i tok nefesh (laip) i stap long han; min i wanpela idiom bilong tok 'em i riskim laip bilong en'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "help",
      "rationale": "תשועה i tok 'sekem\/renkes', olsemtaim 'bikpela help' o 'bikpela win'; 'help' em i tok klostu tasol i no holem olgeta min."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "to Saul",
      "rationale": "Yahonatan i toktok olget long Shaul, king — 'yu' bilong ves em i Shaul."
    },
    {
      "kind": "invitation",
      "subject": "bilong wanem yu laik senim peketa",
      "rationale": "askim bilong sotim Shaul long tingting — em i pulim man long tok bek."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Em i putim ⟨את⟩ laip bilong en long palma bilong en, na em i paitim ⟨את⟩ man bilong Peliset, na Yahwe i wokim bikpela help long olgeta Yisrael; yu lukim na yu amamas; na bilong wanem yu laik senim peketa long blut bilong man i no gat rong, bilong kilim ⟨את⟩ David long nating?",
